summary.label:
Welcome to the princess's castle! Congrats! You are the princess's personal stylist now! Your job is to design dazzling looks for the princess, including dresses, makeup, accessories, etc. Well, let's start the work today!

DRESS UP THE PRINCESS
How are you going to dress up the princess? How about starting with a facial, then designing red-colored makeup and a wavy hairstyle, and finishing with shiny nails? There are various makeup items like hair dye and lipsticks that you can use in the castle. Let's create a summer look for the princess!

VARIOUS CLOTHES
In the dressing room, there are over 50 princess dresses, including the cake dress, fishtail dress and puffy dress, for you to choose from freely. You can also pick a hat, bag, or a pair of glass high heels to go with the dress and make the princess look even more fashionable and trendy.

CREATIVE DESIGN
Look! There is also a design studio in the castle! Come and select colorful feathers to design fashionable feather earrings, embed gems and pearls to create a glittering necklace and unleash your design talent to make distinctive accessories for the princess!

Isn't it fun to be the princess's chief stylist? Design more unique looks for the princess!

FEATURES:
- Play as a stylist;
- Princesses of different skin tones to dress up;
- 50+ gorgeous dresses to choose from;
- 56 pieces of jewelry and nearly 30 hairstyles for you to dress up the princess;
- With more than 400 kinds of items, you can design beautiful dresses, hats, nails, wigs, and much more;
- Obtain limited dresses of different themes!
